### [NEW] [process_all_districts.py](file:///d:/IIT/Academics/BCS/wheat-yield-prediction/Remote%20sensing%20data/landsat_wheat_pipeline/process_all_districts.py)

- Same [DistrictProcessor](file:///d:/IIT/Academics/BCS/wheat-yield-prediction/Remote%20sensing%20data/sentinel2_wheat_pipeline/process_all_districts.py#15-350) orchestration pattern
- Same resume capability (skip already-processed files)
- Same rate limiting, logging, error tracking
- Default years: 2010–2025

